# probe_pair_bound_name_as_a_number.gy — the name the pair road binds is read back as one static number.
# CPython and the interpreted leg print 15; the compiled leg spends exit 1 on the line, because the
# binding carries the (payload, tag) pair and the plain-number road still asks for a payload alone
# (roadmap Gap R.143, measured landing ADR 0267).
xs = []
xs.append([7, 8])
n = xs[0][0] * 2
print(n + 1)
